@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 005 公平順位與投影看板：組件圖（概念層）

actor 老師
component "老師端畫面" as TeacherUI
component "投影看板畫面" as Projector

package "搶答系統（伺服器）" {
  component "活動設定\n(Activity Settings)" as Settings
  component "順位判定（003）" as Rank
  component "公平順位規則\n(Fair Ranking Rule)" as Fair
  component "題目判定排程\n(Settlement Scheduler)" as Sched
  component "投影內容產生\n(Projector View Builder)" as PV
  component "揭曉進度\n(Reveal Progress)" as Reveal
  component "結果彙整（003）" as Result
  component "狀態同步（001）" as Sync
  component "活動階段管理（001）" as Phase
}

老師 --> TeacherUI
老師 --> Projector : 揭曉下一題／全部揭曉
TeacherUI --> Settings : 啟用／不啟用公平順位（僅準備中）
Settings --> Rank : 選擇判定規則
Rank --> Fair : 啟用時使用
Fair --> Sched : 某題第一個答案送達，3 秒後判定
Sched --> Fair : 判定該題
Phase --> Sched : 活動結束，立即判定未完成的題目
Fair --> Result : 各題搶答成功
Projector --> Reveal
Reveal --> PV
Result --> PV
Phase --> PV : 階段與倒數
PV --> Sync
Sync --> Projector : 搶答中不含作答資訊；\n結束後只含已揭曉的題目

note bottom of PV
  搶答中：階段、倒數、各組是否在線
  已結束：已揭曉題目的結果
end note
@enduml
